{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-44314","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50317","text":"κ Integration Spec: Product-Level Specification"}]},{"id":"blk-44315","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50318","text":"Version 0.2.0 — Normalized"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44317","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50319","text":"How the cyclicity invariant κ is computed, surfaced, and used across Graphonomous, BendScript, Deliberatic, TickTickClock, and the [&] Protocol.  "},{"id":"spn-50320","marks":["bold"],"text":"v0.2.0 changes (from Codex review):"},{"id":"spn-50321","text":" - Normalized all field names to a single canonical schema (§2.4) - Resolved tool naming: "},{"id":"spn-50322","marks":["code"],"text":"analyze_topology"},{"id":"spn-50323","text":" is the standalone tool; "},{"id":"spn-50324","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve_context"},{"id":"spn-50325","text":" gains a "},{"id":"spn-50326","marks":["code"],"text":"topology"},{"id":"spn-50327","text":" field — no "},{"id":"spn-50328","marks":["code"],"text":"memory_recall_with_topology"},{"id":"spn-50329","text":" tool - Fixed approximation representation: "},{"id":"spn-50330","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa"},{"id":"spn-50331","text":" is always an integer; large SCCs add "},{"id":"spn-50332","marks":["code"],"text":"approximate: true"},{"id":"spn-50333","text":" (no "},{"id":"spn-50334","marks":["code"],"text":"exact"},{"id":"spn-50335","text":" field) - Added instrumentation requirements (§7) - Clarified BendScript directed-edge policy (§4.3)"}]}],"id":"blk-44316","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-44318","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50336","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-44319","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50337","text":"1. Overview"}]},{"id":"blk-44320","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50338","text":"κ (kappa) is a graph-theoretic invariant that measures the minimum irreducible bidirectional information flow in a directed graph. It is the routing primitive that determines whether a query region of a knowledge graph requires single-pass retrieval (κ = 0) or iterative deliberation (κ > 0)."}]},{"id":"blk-44321","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50339","text":"This spec defines:"}]},{"id":"blk-44322","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44324","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50340","text":"How κ is computed"}]}],"id":"blk-44323","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44326","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50341","text":"Where it is computed in the stack"}]}],"id":"blk-44325","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44328","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50342","text":"How it routes inference"}]}],"id":"blk-44327","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44330","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50343","text":"How it is surfaced to users"}]}],"id":"blk-44329","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44332","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50344","text":"How it integrates with each product"}]}],"id":"blk-44331","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44333","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50345","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-44334","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50346","text":"2. Computation"}]},{"id":"blk-44335","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50347","text":"2.1 Algorithm"}]},{"id":"blk-44336","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"function compute_kappa(graph):\n    # Pre-step: define node universe U from the analyzed subgraph/query result.\n    # Ignore any edge where src ∉ U or dst ∉ U.\n    # Exclude self-loops (u -> u) from adjacency for κ computation.\n    # Step 1: Find all strongly connected components\n    sccs = tarjan_scc(graph)                    # O(V + E)\n\n    # Step 2: For each nontrivial SCC (size > 1)\n    results = []\n    for scc in sccs where |scc| > 1:\n        # Step 3: Enumerate bipartitions, find minimum bidirectional cut\n        k = infinity\n        for (A, B) in nontrivial_bipartitions(scc):\n            edges_a_to_b = count_edges(A, B, graph)\n            edges_b_to_a = count_edges(B, A, graph)\n            bidirectional_cut = min(edges_a_to_b, edges_b_to_a)\n            k = min(k, bidirectional_cut)\n            if k == 0: break  # early exit (can't go lower)\n\n        # Step 4: Record SCC with its κ value and minimum-cut partition\n        results.append({\n            scc: scc,\n            kappa: k,\n            min_cut_partition: (A_min, B_min),\n            min_cut_edges: edges_achieving_minimum\n        })\n\n    return results"},{"id":"blk-44337","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50348","text":"2.2 Complexity"}]},{"id":"blk-44338","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44340","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50349","marks":["bold"],"text":"SCC decomposition:"},{"id":"spn-50350","text":" O(V + E) via Tarjan's algorithm"}]}],"id":"blk-44339","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44342","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50351","marks":["bold"],"text":"κ computation per SCC:"},{"id":"spn-50352","text":" O(2^|SCC| × |SCC|²) in the worst case (enumerating all bipartitions)"}]}],"id":"blk-44341","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44344","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50353","marks":["bold"],"text":"Practical constraint:"},{"id":"spn-50354","text":" For SCCs up to ~20 nodes, bipartition enumeration is feasible in real time. For larger SCCs, use approximation:"}]}],"id":"blk-44343","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44346","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50355","text":"Return SCC size as a proxy for κ, with "},{"id":"spn-50356","marks":["code"],"text":"approximate: true"},{"id":"spn-50357","text":" flag"}]}],"id":"blk-44345","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44348","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50358","text":"κ field remains an integer (the estimate), never a symbol/atom/string"}]}],"id":"blk-44347","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44350","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50359","marks":["bold"],"text":"Node-universe rule (NORMATIVE):"},{"id":"spn-50360","text":" Analyze only the node set supplied by retrieval/query scope (or explicit "},{"id":"spn-50361","marks":["code"],"text":"node_ids"},{"id":"spn-50362","text":" input). Do not pull in external nodes implicitly during κ analysis."}]}],"id":"blk-44349","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44352","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50363","marks":["bold"],"text":"Self-loop rule (NORMATIVE):"},{"id":"spn-50364","text":" Exclude self-loops ("},{"id":"spn-50365","marks":["code"],"text":"source == target"},{"id":"spn-50366","text":") from κ adjacency and cut counts."}]}],"id":"blk-44351","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44353","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50367","text":"2.3 Incremental Updates"}]},{"id":"blk-44354","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50368","text":"When an edge is added or removed from the knowledge graph:"}]},{"id":"blk-44355","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50369","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-50370","marks":["bold"],"text":"Edge addition:"},{"id":"spn-50371","text":" Can only merge SCCs or enlarge existing ones. Re-run Tarjan on the affected component. If a new nontrivial SCC is formed, compute κ for it. 2. "},{"id":"spn-50372","marks":["bold"],"text":"Edge removal:"},{"id":"spn-50373","text":" Can only split SCCs or shrink them. Re-run Tarjan on the affected component. Recompute κ for any remaining nontrivial SCCs. 3. "},{"id":"spn-50374","marks":["bold"],"text":"Optimization:"},{"id":"spn-50375","text":" Maintain an SCC index alongside the knowledge graph. Incremental SCC algorithms (e.g., Bender, Fineman & Gilbert 2015) can update SCCs in O(V) amortized per edge change."}]},{"id":"blk-44356","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50376","text":"2.4 Canonical Schema (NORMATIVE — all implementations must match)"}]},{"id":"blk-44357","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50377","text":"Every κ topology result — whether from Elixir, JavaScript, or MCP JSON — uses these exact field names:"}]},{"id":"blk-44358","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"sccs\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"scc-0\",\n      \"nodes\": [\"node-a\", \"node-b\"],\n      \"kappa\": 2,\n      \"approximate\": false,\n      \"fault_line_edges\": [\n        {\"source\": \"node-a\", \"target\": \"node-b\"}\n      ],\n      \"routing\": \"deliberate\",\n      \"deliberation_budget\": {\n        \"max_iterations\": 3,\n        \"agent_count\": 2,\n        \"timeout_multiplier\": 2.0,\n        \"confidence_threshold\": 0.80\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"dag_nodes\": [\"node-x\", \"node-y\"],\n  \"routing\": \"deliberate\",\n  \"max_kappa\": 2,\n  \"scc_count\": 1\n}"},{"id":"blk-44359","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50378","marks":["bold"],"text":"Field name rules (resolves all drift):"}]},{"id":"blk-44360","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44362","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50379","text":"Top-level routing key: "},{"id":"spn-50380","marks":["code"],"text":"routing"},{"id":"spn-50381","text":" (not "},{"id":"spn-50382","marks":["code"],"text":"overall_routing"},{"id":"spn-50383","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-44361","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44364","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50384","text":"Edge endpoints: "},{"id":"spn-50385","marks":["code"],"text":"source"},{"id":"spn-50386","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-50387","marks":["code"],"text":"target"},{"id":"spn-50388","text":" (not "},{"id":"spn-50389","marks":["code"],"text":"from"},{"id":"spn-50390","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-50391","marks":["code"],"text":"to"},{"id":"spn-50392","text":", not "},{"id":"spn-50393","marks":["code"],"text":"a"},{"id":"spn-50394","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-50395","marks":["code"],"text":"b"},{"id":"spn-50396","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-44363","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44366","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50397","text":"Fault lines: "},{"id":"spn-50398","marks":["code"],"text":"fault_line_edges"},{"id":"spn-50399","text":" (not "},{"id":"spn-50400","marks":["code"],"text":"min_cut_edges"},{"id":"spn-50401","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-44365","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44368","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50402","text":"κ type: always "},{"id":"spn-50403","marks":["code"],"text":"integer"},{"id":"spn-50404","text":" (never string, atom, or symbol)"}]}],"id":"blk-44367","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44370","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50405","text":"Approximation: "},{"id":"spn-50406","marks":["code"],"text":"\"approximate\": true"},{"id":"spn-50407","text":" boolean flag on the SCC object; "},{"id":"spn-50408","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa"},{"id":"spn-50409","text":" still holds the integer estimate"}]}],"id":"blk-44369","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44372","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50410","text":"Routing values: "},{"id":"spn-50411","marks":["code"],"text":"\"fast\""},{"id":"spn-50412","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-50413","marks":["code"],"text":"\"deliberate\""},{"id":"spn-50414","text":" (strings in JSON, atoms "},{"id":"spn-50415","marks":["code"],"text":":fast"},{"id":"spn-50416","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-50417","marks":["code"],"text":":deliberate"},{"id":"spn-50418","text":" in Elixir, strings in JS)"}]}],"id":"blk-44371","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44373","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50419","marks":["bold"],"text":"Schema boundary rules (NORMATIVE):"}]},{"id":"blk-44374","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44376","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50420","marks":["bold"],"text":"On MCP/JSON boundaries:"},{"id":"spn-50421","text":" use canonical snake_case keys exactly as defined in §2.4 ("},{"id":"spn-50422","marks":["code"],"text":"fault_line_edges"},{"id":"spn-50423","text":", "},{"id":"spn-50424","marks":["code"],"text":"max_kappa"},{"id":"spn-50425","text":", "},{"id":"spn-50426","marks":["code"],"text":"scc_count"},{"id":"spn-50427","text":", etc.)."}]}],"id":"blk-44375","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44378","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50428","marks":["bold"],"text":"Inside Elixir runtime:"},{"id":"spn-50429","text":" atoms are allowed for routing values ("},{"id":"spn-50430","marks":["code"],"text":":fast"},{"id":"spn-50431","text":", "},{"id":"spn-50432","marks":["code"],"text":":deliberate"},{"id":"spn-50433","text":"), but keys remain canonical and are serialized to JSON strings at the boundary."}]}],"id":"blk-44377","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44380","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50434","marks":["bold"],"text":"Inside JavaScript UI code:"},{"id":"spn-50435","text":" camelCase mirrors are allowed for local-only objects ("},{"id":"spn-50436","marks":["code"],"text":"faultLineEdges"},{"id":"spn-50437","text":", "},{"id":"spn-50438","marks":["code"],"text":"maxKappa"},{"id":"spn-50439","text":", "},{"id":"spn-50440","marks":["code"],"text":"sccCount"},{"id":"spn-50441","text":") for ergonomics, but any network payload or persisted topology record must be converted back to canonical snake_case."}]}],"id":"blk-44379","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44381","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50442","marks":["bold"],"text":"Elixir atom mapping:"}]},{"id":"blk-44382","kind":"code","language":"elixir","text":"# Elixir uses atoms internally, converts to strings for MCP JSON\n:fast       → \"fast\"\n:deliberate → \"deliberate\""},{"id":"blk-44383","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50443","marks":["bold"],"text":"JavaScript mapping (local only):"}]},{"id":"blk-44384","kind":"code","language":"javascript","text":"// Local object ergonomics\n{ faultLineEdges, maxKappa, sccCount, routing }\n\n// MCP / wire payloads must remain canonical snake_case\n{ fault_line_edges, max_kappa, scc_count, routing }"},{"id":"blk-44385","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50444","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-44386","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50445","text":"3. Routing Logic"}]},{"id":"blk-44387","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50446","text":"3.1 The κ Router"}]},{"id":"blk-44388","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50447","text":"The κ router sits between memory retrieval and reasoning. It inspects the topological structure of the retrieved subgraph and makes a routing decision."}]},{"id":"blk-44389","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"function kappa_route(retrieved_subgraph):\n    scc_analysis = compute_kappa(retrieved_subgraph)\n\n    dag_context = nodes NOT in any nontrivial SCC\n    scc_contexts = scc_analysis  # list of {scc, kappa, fault_line_edges, ...}\n\n    # DAG regions: single-pass retrieval\n    retrieval_context = topological_sort_and_collect(dag_context)\n\n    # SCC regions: flag for deliberation\n    deliberation_tasks = []\n    for scc_info in scc_contexts:\n        deliberation_tasks.append({\n            nodes: scc_info.scc,\n            kappa: scc_info.kappa,\n            fault_lines: scc_info.fault_line_edges,\n            budget: deliberation_budget(scc_info.kappa)\n        })\n\n    return {\n        retrieval_context: retrieval_context,\n        deliberation_tasks: deliberation_tasks,\n        routing: \"fast\" if len(deliberation_tasks) == 0 else \"deliberate\"\n    }"},{"id":"blk-44390","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50448","text":"3.2 Deliberation Budget Function"}]},{"id":"blk-44391","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50449","text":"The deliberation budget maps κ to concrete inference parameters. This is an engineering heuristic (not proved — to be tuned empirically). Caps on "},{"id":"spn-50450","marks":["code"],"text":"max_iterations"},{"id":"spn-50451","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-50452","marks":["code"],"text":"confidence_threshold"},{"id":"spn-50453","text":" are required to prevent runaway values when "},{"id":"spn-50454","marks":["code"],"text":"approximate: true"},{"id":"spn-50455","text":" SCCs use size-based κ estimates:"}]},{"id":"blk-44392","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"function deliberation_budget(kappa):\n    return {\n        max_iterations: min(kappa + 1, 4),\n        agent_count: min(kappa, 3),\n        timeout_multiplier: min(1.0 + 0.5*kappa, 3.5),\n        confidence_threshold: min(0.7 + 0.05*kappa, 0.95)\n    }"},{"id":"blk-44393","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50456","text":"3.3 The Fast Path vs. Deliberation Path"}]},{"id":"blk-44394","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"             ┌─────────────────┐\n             │  Query arrives   │\n             └────────┬────────┘\n                      │\n                      ▼\n             ┌─────────────────┐\n             │  &memory.recall  │   Graphonomous retrieves relevant subgraph\n             └────────┬────────┘\n                      │\n                      ▼\n             ┌─────────────────┐\n             │  κ Router        │   Compute SCCs, κ values\n             └────────┬────────┘\n                      │\n              ┌───────┴────────┐\n              │                │\n         κ = 0 (all DAG)    κ > 0 (has SCCs)\n              │                │\n              ▼                ▼\n       ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────────┐\n       │ Fast Path │    │  Deliberation │\n       │ single    │    │  &reason via  │\n       │ pass      │    │  Deliberatic  │\n       │ retrieval │    │  κ-informed   │\n       └─────┬────┘    │  budget       │\n             │         └──────┬───────┘\n             │                │\n             └───────┬────────┘\n                     │\n                     ▼\n             ┌──────────────┐\n             │  &memory.learn │   Results feed back into graph\n             └──────────────┘"},{"id":"blk-44395","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50457","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-44396","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50458","text":"4. Product Integration"}]},{"id":"blk-44397","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50459","text":"4.1 Graphonomous"}]},{"id":"blk-44398","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50460","marks":["bold"],"text":"Where κ lives:"},{"id":"spn-50461","text":" Computed at query time on the retrieved subgraph. Cached per SCC in the knowledge graph index; invalidated on edge changes."}]},{"id":"blk-44399","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50462","marks":["bold"],"text":"What changes:"}]},{"id":"blk-44400","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44402","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50463","marks":["code"],"text":"Retriever.retrieve/2"},{"id":"spn-50464","text":" now returns a "},{"id":"spn-50465","marks":["code"],"text":"topology"},{"id":"spn-50466","text":" key alongside existing "},{"id":"spn-50467","marks":["code"],"text":"results"},{"id":"spn-50468","text":", "},{"id":"spn-50469","marks":["code"],"text":"causal_context"},{"id":"spn-50470","text":", "},{"id":"spn-50471","marks":["code"],"text":"stats"}]}],"id":"blk-44401","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44404","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50472","text":"New module "},{"id":"spn-50473","marks":["code"],"text":"Graphonomous.Topology"},{"id":"spn-50474","text":" computes and returns the full SCC analysis for a given subgraph"}]}],"id":"blk-44403","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44406","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50475","text":"New function "},{"id":"spn-50476","marks":["code"],"text":"Store.list_edges_between/1"},{"id":"spn-50477","text":" fetches edges within a node set"}]}],"id":"blk-44405","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44407","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50478","marks":["bold"],"text":"MCP tool: `analyze_topology` (NEW standalone tool):"}]},{"id":"blk-44408","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"name\": \"analyze_topology\",\n  \"description\": \"Compute topological structure (SCCs, κ values, routing decision) for a set of nodes in the knowledge graph.\",\n  \"inputSchema\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"node_ids\": {\n        \"type\": \"array\",\n        \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"description\": \"Node IDs to analyze. If omitted, analyzes the full graph.\"\n      },\n      \"query\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\",\n        \"description\": \"Optional query text. If provided, retrieves relevant nodes first, then analyzes their topology.\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-44409","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50479","marks":["bold"],"text":"MCP tool: `retrieve_context` (EXISTING — augmented with topology):"}]},{"id":"blk-44410","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50480","text":"The existing "},{"id":"spn-50481","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve_context"},{"id":"spn-50482","text":" tool gains a "},{"id":"spn-50483","marks":["code"],"text":"topology"},{"id":"spn-50484","text":" field in its response. No new tool name — same endpoint, richer response:"}]},{"id":"blk-44411","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"query\": \"company strategy\",\n  \"count\": 7,\n  \"results\": [\"...existing results...\"],\n  \"causal_context\": [\"...existing...\"],\n  \"stats\": {\"...existing...\"},\n  \"topology\": {\n    \"sccs\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"scc-0\",\n        \"nodes\": [\"market-share\", \"revenue\", \"r-and-d\", \"product-quality\", \"customer-retention\"],\n        \"kappa\": 1,\n        \"approximate\": false,\n        \"fault_line_edges\": [\n          {\"source\": \"product-quality\", \"target\": \"market-share\"}\n        ],\n        \"routing\": \"deliberate\",\n        \"deliberation_budget\": {\n          \"max_iterations\": 2,\n          \"agent_count\": 1,\n          \"timeout_multiplier\": 1.5,\n          \"confidence_threshold\": 0.75\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"dag_nodes\": [\"founding-date\", \"ceo-name\", \"headquarters\"],\n    \"routing\": \"deliberate\",\n    \"max_kappa\": 1,\n    \"scc_count\": 1\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-44412","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50485","text":"4.2 Deliberatic"}]},{"id":"blk-44413","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50486","marks":["bold"],"text":"What changes:"}]},{"id":"blk-44414","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44416","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50487","text":"Accepts "},{"id":"spn-50488","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa"},{"id":"spn-50489","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-50490","marks":["code"],"text":"fault_line_edges"},{"id":"spn-50491","text":" as input parameters on its deliberation endpoint."}]}],"id":"blk-44415","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44418","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50492","text":"Uses "},{"id":"spn-50493","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa"},{"id":"spn-50494","text":" to set argumentation depth (number of rounds)."}]}],"id":"blk-44417","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44420","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50495","text":"Uses "},{"id":"spn-50496","marks":["code"],"text":"fault_line_edges"},{"id":"spn-50497","text":" (minimum-cut edges) to generate the initial propositions that agents must argue about — these are the critical bidirectional dependencies."}]}],"id":"blk-44419","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44421","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50498","marks":["bold"],"text":"MCP tool additions:"}]},{"id":"blk-44422","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"name\": \"deliberate_on_scc\",\n  \"description\": \"Run structured argumentation on a strongly connected knowledge cluster. Uses κ to set deliberation budget and fault lines to seed propositions.\",\n  \"inputSchema\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"scc_nodes\": { \"type\": \"array\", \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" } },\n      \"scc_edges\": { \"type\": \"array\" },\n      \"kappa\": { \"type\": \"integer\" },\n      \"fault_line_edges\": { \"type\": \"array\" },\n      \"governance\": { \"type\": \"object\" }\n    }\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-44423","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50499","marks":["bold"],"text":"Key insight:"},{"id":"spn-50500","text":" Deliberatic doesn't need to know about graph theory. It receives a set of propositions (derived from fault lines), a budget (derived from κ), and it argues. The graph intelligence lives in Graphonomous; the argumentation intelligence lives in Deliberatic. κ is the handshake between them."}]},{"id":"blk-44424","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50501","text":"4.3 BendScript"}]},{"id":"blk-44425","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50502","marks":["bold"],"text":"What changes:"}]},{"id":"blk-44426","kind":"heading","level":4,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50503","text":"Directed-Edge Policy (NORMATIVE)"}]},{"id":"blk-44427","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50504","text":"BendScript edges have a "},{"id":"spn-50505","marks":["code"],"text":"kind"},{"id":"spn-50506","text":" property. For κ computation, edge directionality is determined by kind:"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-44429","spans":[{"id":"spn-50507","text":"Edge kind"}]},{"id":"blk-44430","spans":[{"id":"spn-50508","text":"Directionality for κ"}]},{"id":"blk-44431","spans":[{"id":"spn-50509","text":"Rationale"}]}],"id":"blk-44428","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-44432","spans":[{"id":"spn-50510","marks":["code"],"text":"causal"}]},{"id":"blk-44433","spans":[{"id":"spn-50511","marks":["bold"],"text":"Directed"},{"id":"spn-50512","text":" (a → b)"}]},{"id":"blk-44434","spans":[{"id":"spn-50513","text":"Cause precedes effect"}]}],[{"id":"blk-44435","spans":[{"id":"spn-50514","marks":["code"],"text":"temporal"}]},{"id":"blk-44436","spans":[{"id":"spn-50515","marks":["bold"],"text":"Directed"},{"id":"spn-50516","text":" (a → b)"}]},{"id":"blk-44437","spans":[{"id":"spn-50517","text":"Before precedes after"}]}],[{"id":"blk-44438","spans":[{"id":"spn-50518","marks":["code"],"text":"context"}]},{"id":"blk-44439","spans":[{"id":"spn-50519","marks":["bold"],"text":"Skip"},{"id":"spn-50520","text":" (excluded from κ graph)"}]},{"id":"blk-44440","spans":[{"id":"spn-50521","text":"Symmetric, no feedback"}]}],[{"id":"blk-44441","spans":[{"id":"spn-50522","marks":["code"],"text":"associative"}]},{"id":"blk-44442","spans":[{"id":"spn-50523","marks":["bold"],"text":"Skip"},{"id":"spn-50524","text":" (excluded from κ graph)"}]},{"id":"blk-44443","spans":[{"id":"spn-50525","text":"Symmetric, no feedback"}]}],[{"id":"blk-44444","spans":[{"id":"spn-50526","marks":["code"],"text":"user"}]},{"id":"blk-44445","spans":[{"id":"spn-50527","marks":["bold"],"text":"Skip"},{"id":"spn-50528","text":" (excluded from κ graph)"}]},{"id":"blk-44446","spans":[{"id":"spn-50529","text":"Ambiguous directionality"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-44447","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50530","text":"This is a "},{"id":"spn-50531","marks":["bold"],"text":"hard rule"},{"id":"spn-50532","text":", not a toggle. Only "},{"id":"spn-50533","marks":["code"],"text":"causal"},{"id":"spn-50534","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-50535","marks":["code"],"text":"temporal"},{"id":"spn-50536","text":" edges participate in SCC/κ computation. The filter constant:"}]},{"id":"blk-44448","kind":"code","language":"javascript","text":"const DIRECTED_KINDS = ['causal', 'temporal'];"},{"id":"blk-44449","kind":"heading","level":4,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50537","text":"Visual Layer"}]},{"id":"blk-44450","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44452","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50538","marks":["bold"],"text":"SCC clusters rendered visually:"},{"id":"spn-50539","text":" Nodes within a nontrivial SCC share a colored halo or background region. Color intensity scales with κ."}]}],"id":"blk-44451","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44454","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50540","marks":["bold"],"text":"Minimum-cut edges highlighted:"},{"id":"spn-50541","text":" Fault-line edges rendered in dashed style ("},{"id":"spn-50542","marks":["code"],"text":"ctx.setLineDash([6, 4])"},{"id":"spn-50543","text":") with brighter color."}]}],"id":"blk-44453","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44456","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50544","marks":["bold"],"text":"κ badge on SCC clusters:"},{"id":"spn-50545","text":" Each SCC cluster shows its κ value as a small badge, e.g., \"κ=2\"."}]}],"id":"blk-44455","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44457","kind":"heading","level":4,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50546","text":"Interaction Layer"}]},{"id":"blk-44458","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44460","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50547","marks":["bold"],"text":"Topology preview via context menu:"},{"id":"spn-50548","text":" When the user right-clicks a node and selects \"Connect to…\" (a new context menu item), BendScript shows candidate target nodes with topology impact annotations:"}]}],"id":"blk-44459","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44462","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50549","text":"\"→ NodeX: creates feedback loop (κ: 0→1)\""}]}],"id":"blk-44461","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44464","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50550","text":"\"→ NodeY: strengthens loop (κ: 1→2)\""}]}],"id":"blk-44463","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44466","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50551","text":"\"→ NodeZ: no topological change\""}]}],"id":"blk-44465","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44468","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50552","marks":["bold"],"text":"\"Bend\" action:"},{"id":"spn-50553","text":" Right-click context menu on DAG nodes — automatically suggests the nearest edge that would create a feedback loop."}]}],"id":"blk-44467","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44470","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50554","marks":["bold"],"text":"\"Unbend\" action:"},{"id":"spn-50555","text":" Right-click context menu on SCC nodes — identifies the fault-line edge and offers to remove it."}]}],"id":"blk-44469","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44471","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50556","marks":["bold"],"text":"Note:"},{"id":"spn-50557","text":" BendScript does NOT currently have drag-to-connect edge creation. The topology preview is accessed via the context menu \"Connect to…\" flow. Do not implement drag-to-connect in this phase."}]},{"id":"blk-44472","kind":"heading","level":4,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50558","text":"HUD"}]},{"id":"blk-44473","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44475","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50559","marks":["bold"],"text":"Global κ display:"},{"id":"spn-50560","text":" The existing HUD gains a κ readout showing the maximum κ across all SCCs in the graph, and a count of SCCs."}]}],"id":"blk-44474","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44477","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50561","marks":["bold"],"text":"Routing indicator:"},{"id":"spn-50562","text":" \"mode: RETRIEVAL\" (all κ = 0) or \"mode: DELIBERATION\" (any κ > 0)."}]}],"id":"blk-44476","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44478","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50563","text":"4.4 The [&] Protocol"}]},{"id":"blk-44479","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50564","marks":["bold"],"text":"Grammar extension:"}]},{"id":"blk-44480","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"# Extended [&] capability grammar — topology-aware routing\nTopologyOp      := \"&topology\" \".\" (\"analyze\" | \"route\" | \"kappa\")\n\n# Updated pipeline pattern\nInferencePipeline :=\n    \"&memory.recall\" \"(\" QueryExpr \")\"\n    \"|>\" \"&topology.analyze\" \"()\"\n    \"|>\" \"&topology.route\" \"()\"\n    \"|>\" \"&reason.deliberate\" \"(\" \"budget:\" \":κ\" \")\"\n    \"|>\" \"&memory.learn\" \"()\""},{"id":"blk-44481","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50565","marks":["bold"],"text":"Schema extension (ampersand.schema.json):"}]},{"id":"blk-44482","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"capabilities\": {\n    \"&topology.analyze\": {\n      \"provider\": \"graphonomous\",\n      \"description\": \"Compute SCC decomposition and κ values for a subgraph\",\n      \"config\": {\n        \"max_scc_size_for_exact\": 20,\n        \"approximation_strategy\": \"scc_size_proxy\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"&topology.route\": {\n      \"provider\": \"builtin\",\n      \"description\": \"Route inference based on κ: DAG regions → fast path, SCC regions → deliberation\",\n      \"config\": {\n        \"deliberation_provider\": \"deliberatic\",\n        \"fast_path_provider\": \"graphonomous\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-44483","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50566","text":"4.5 TickTickClock"}]},{"id":"blk-44484","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50567","marks":["bold"],"text":"Connection:"},{"id":"spn-50568","text":" For discrete time-series dynamics, the transition graph of the system has κ > 0 if and only if the system has a periodic orbit. TickTickClock can use this as a formal periodicity detector:"}]},{"id":"blk-44485","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44487","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50569","text":"Discretize time-series data into state transitions"}]}],"id":"blk-44486","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44489","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50570","text":"Build the transition graph"}]}],"id":"blk-44488","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44491","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50571","text":"Compute κ"}]}],"id":"blk-44490","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44493","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50572","text":"κ > 0 → periodic pattern detected, flag for temporal reasoning"}]}],"id":"blk-44492","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44495","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50573","text":"κ = 0 → pure drift, no recurrence"}]}],"id":"blk-44494","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44496","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50574","text":"This is a secondary integration (TickTickClock already has Mamba SSM for pattern detection), but it provides a complementary structural signal."}]},{"id":"blk-44497","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50575","text":"4.6 OpenSentience"}]},{"id":"blk-44498","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50576","marks":["bold"],"text":"Role:"},{"id":"spn-50577","text":" Research home for the theoretical foundations. Hosts:"}]},{"id":"blk-44499","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44501","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50578","text":"The κ paper (theoretical background, proofs, categorical framework)"}]}],"id":"blk-44500","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44503","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50579","text":"The proof code (runnable verification)"}]}],"id":"blk-44502","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44505","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50580","text":"Interactive demos (live κ computation on user-constructed graphs)"}]}],"id":"blk-44504","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44507","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50581","text":"The original Scale Topology Axis essay (broader theoretical context connecting κ to physics, cosmology, and consciousness science)"}]}],"id":"blk-44506","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44508","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50582","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-44509","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50583","text":"5. Implementation Priority"}]},{"id":"blk-44510","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50584","text":"Phase 1: Core (ship first)"}]},{"id":"blk-44511","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44513","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50585","text":"[ ] Port κ computation to Elixir (Graphonomous server-side)"}]}],"id":"blk-44512","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44515","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50586","text":"[ ] Port κ computation to JavaScript (BendScript client-side)"}]}],"id":"blk-44514","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44517","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50587","text":"[ ] Integrate Tarjan's SCC into Graphonomous's graph index"}]}],"id":"blk-44516","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44519","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50588","text":"[ ] Return topology annotations from "},{"id":"spn-50589","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve_context"}]}],"id":"blk-44518","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44521","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50590","text":"[ ] Add SCC visualization to BendScript canvas"}]}],"id":"blk-44520","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44522","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50591","text":"Phase 2: Routing (ship second)"}]},{"id":"blk-44523","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44525","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50592","text":"[ ] Implement κ router in the [&] pipeline"}]}],"id":"blk-44524","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44527","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50593","text":"[ ] Connect κ router to Deliberatic trigger"}]}],"id":"blk-44526","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44529","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50594","text":"[ ] Add deliberation budget function"}]}],"id":"blk-44528","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44531","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50595","text":"[ ] Test on real knowledge graph queries: does κ-aware routing improve answer quality?"}]}],"id":"blk-44530","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44532","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50596","text":"Phase 3: Polish (ship third)"}]},{"id":"blk-44533","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44535","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50597","text":"[ ] BendScript topology preview via context menu"}]}],"id":"blk-44534","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44537","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50598","text":"[ ] Bend/Unbend context menu actions"}]}],"id":"blk-44536","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44539","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50599","text":"[ ] HUD κ display and routing indicator"}]}],"id":"blk-44538","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44541","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50600","text":"[ ] TickTickClock periodicity detection via κ"}]}],"id":"blk-44540","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44543","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50601","text":"[ ] OpenSentience publication of κ paper and demos"}]}],"id":"blk-44542","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44544","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50602","text":"Phase 4: Optimization"}]},{"id":"blk-44545","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44547","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50603","text":"[ ] Incremental SCC maintenance (avoid full recomputation on every edge change)"}]}],"id":"blk-44546","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44549","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50604","text":"[ ] Approximate κ for large SCCs (> 20 nodes)"}]}],"id":"blk-44548","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44551","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50605","text":"[ ] Benchmark: latency impact of topology computation on query path"}]}],"id":"blk-44550","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44553","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50606","text":"[ ] A/B test: κ-routed inference vs. uniform retrieval on quality metrics"}]}],"id":"blk-44552","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44554","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50607","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-44555","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50608","text":"6. Success Metrics"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-44557","spans":[{"id":"spn-50609","text":"Metric"}]},{"id":"blk-44558","spans":[{"id":"spn-50610","text":"Baseline (no κ)"}]},{"id":"blk-44559","spans":[{"id":"spn-50611","text":"Target (with κ)"}]},{"id":"blk-44560","spans":[{"id":"spn-50612","text":"How to Measure"}]}],"id":"blk-44556","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-44561","spans":[{"id":"spn-50613","text":"Answer coherence on circular topics"}]},{"id":"blk-44562","spans":[{"id":"spn-50614","text":"Human eval ~60%"}]},{"id":"blk-44563","spans":[{"id":"spn-50615","text":"Human eval ~80%"}]},{"id":"blk-44564","spans":[{"id":"spn-50616","text":"Blind eval on queries touching SCCs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-44565","spans":[{"id":"spn-50617","text":"Unnecessary deliberation calls"}]},{"id":"blk-44566","spans":[{"id":"spn-50618","text":"N/A (no routing)"}]},{"id":"blk-44567","spans":[{"id":"spn-50619","text":"< 20% of queries"}]},{"id":"blk-44568","spans":[{"id":"spn-50620","text":"Track κ=0 queries that hit deliberation anyway"}]}],[{"id":"blk-44569","spans":[{"id":"spn-50621","text":"Deliberation convergence speed"}]},{"id":"blk-44570","spans":[{"id":"spn-50622","text":"Fixed rounds"}]},{"id":"blk-44571","spans":[{"id":"spn-50623","text":"κ+1 rounds avg"}]},{"id":"blk-44572","spans":[{"id":"spn-50624","text":"Measure rounds to convergence"}]}],[{"id":"blk-44573","spans":[{"id":"spn-50625","text":"User engagement in BendScript"}]},{"id":"blk-44574","spans":[{"id":"spn-50626","text":"Nodes/edges per session"}]},{"id":"blk-44575","spans":[{"id":"spn-50627","text":"+30%"}]},{"id":"blk-44576","spans":[{"id":"spn-50628","text":"Track topology actions (bend/unbend/stargate)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-44577","spans":[{"id":"spn-50629","text":"OpenSentience traffic"}]},{"id":"blk-44578","spans":[{"id":"spn-50630","text":"Baseline"}]},{"id":"blk-44579","spans":[{"id":"spn-50631","text":"Organic from dev community"}]},{"id":"blk-44580","spans":[{"id":"spn-50632","text":"Track referrals from product UIs"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-44581","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50633","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-44582","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50634","text":"7. Instrumentation Requirements (NEW in v0.2.0)"}]},{"id":"blk-44583","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50635","text":"All κ computation must emit telemetry. This is required for Gate C (performance) and Gate D (product effect) validation."}]},{"id":"blk-44584","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50636","text":"7.1 Latency Counters (Elixir — "},{"id":"spn-50637","marks":["code"],"text":":telemetry"},{"id":"spn-50638","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-44585","kind":"code","language":"elixir","text":"# Emit on every topology computation\n# REQUIRED UNIT: duration_ms (float milliseconds)\n# If measured via :timer.tc/1, convert with: duration_ms = duration_us / 1000.0\n:telemetry.execute(\n  [:graphonomous, :topology, :analyze],\n  %{duration_ms: elapsed_ms, node_count: n, edge_count: e},\n  %{scc_count: scc_count, max_kappa: max_kappa, routing: routing}\n)"},{"id":"blk-44586","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50639","text":"Track:"}]},{"id":"blk-44587","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44589","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50640","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.analyze.duration_ms"},{"id":"spn-50641","text":" — p50, p95, p99 (canonical latency metric)"}]}],"id":"blk-44588","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44591","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50642","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.analyze.node_count"},{"id":"spn-50643","text":" — distribution of subgraph sizes"}]}],"id":"blk-44590","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44593","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50644","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.analyze.edge_count"},{"id":"spn-50645","text":" — distribution of subgraph densities"}]}],"id":"blk-44592","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44595","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50646","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.analyze.scc_count"},{"id":"spn-50647","text":" — how often SCCs are found"}]}],"id":"blk-44594","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44597","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50648","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.analyze.routing.deliberate_ratio"},{"id":"spn-50649","text":" — deliberate / total analyzes"}]}],"id":"blk-44596","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44599","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50650","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.analyze.self_loop_filtered_count"},{"id":"spn-50651","text":" — number of self-loops ignored during adjacency construction"}]}],"id":"blk-44598","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44600","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50652","text":"7.2 Routing Decision Counters"}]},{"id":"blk-44601","kind":"code","language":"elixir","text":":telemetry.execute(\n  [:graphonomous, :topology, :route],\n  %{},\n  %{decision: :fast | :deliberate, max_kappa: max_kappa, trigger: :retrieve_context | :analyze_topology}\n)"},{"id":"blk-44602","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50653","text":"Track:"}]},{"id":"blk-44603","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44605","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50654","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.route.fast_count"},{"id":"spn-50655","text":" — queries routed to fast path"}]}],"id":"blk-44604","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44607","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50656","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.route.deliberate_count"},{"id":"spn-50657","text":" — queries routed to deliberation"}]}],"id":"blk-44606","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-44609","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50658","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.route.deliberate_ratio"},{"id":"spn-50659","text":" — deliberate / total (target: < 30% on typical workloads)"}]}],"id":"blk-44608","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-44610","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50660","text":"7.3 BendScript Performance (JavaScript — "},{"id":"spn-50661","marks":["code"],"text":"performance.now()"},{"id":"spn-50662","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-44611","kind":"code","language":"javascript","text":"const t0 = performance.now();\nconst topo = analyzeTopology(plane);\nconst elapsed = performance.now() - t0;\nconsole.debug(`[κ] topology: ${elapsed.toFixed(1)}ms, maxκ=${topo.maxKappa}, sccs=${topo.sccCount}`);"},{"id":"blk-44612","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50663","text":"Target: < 50ms at 100 nodes."}]},{"id":"blk-44613","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50664","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-44614","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50665","text":"*Spec version: 0.2.0. Status: Draft (normalized). Depends on: kappa_reference.py (computation), kappa_theory_applied.md (theoretical foundations). Products affected: Graphonomous, Deliberatic, BendScript, [&] Protocol, TickTickClock, OpenSentience.*"}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierantcc65bokoyzgv2ii45r5xuepbugdg2xjvbjkls62evhct6ambwa","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}